[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/props/water_tint.gd" id="17_water_tint"]

; A waterfall falling from a small rocky hill into a short stream that flows towards +X.
; The origin is where the stream meets the pond. Pieces use the same 1.2 scale as the pond
; tiles, so one piece is 1.2 m wide and one cliff level is 1.2 m high.
; The hill steps down: two levels behind the waterfall, one level on the shoulders, with
; bushes and trees on top so it reads as a mossy hill instead of a box.
; If a piece shows up facing the wrong way, change only its rotation_degrees.y.

